 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the figure shown to find the weight of the given spanning tree.\n<br>\n\n<img src=\"exercises/media/9ec8a5245767a896.png\" alt=\"Graph Z has nine vertices arranged in 3 rows and 3 columns. The vertices are as follows. Row 1: q, r, s. Row 2: t, u, v. Row 3; w, x, y. The edges are as follows. 1, q to t. 2, s to v. 3, r to s. 4, q to u. 5, u to y. 6, r to v. 7, r to u. 8, v to y. 9, w to x. 10, x to y. 1, u to x. 12, t to w. 13, q to r. 14, t to u. 15, u to v.\">\n",
